    "description": "<b>Messages</b> can connect with people everywhere, send SMS, text message without internet connection. Send Free Messages to all your messaging and social apps from one text messaging app. Fast texting, easy chat and private messaging!\r\n\r\nMessages is a free text messaging application for sending and receiving messages. No internet connection required. Send various content. Send text or send multimedia messages, such as photos, cute emojis, beautiful stickers, or make a quick call in a chat. Messages is provide best SMS service for SMS organiser app. Best SMS Organizer app for text Messaging.\r\n\r\nMessages App is a messaging app which enables you to send private text messages to your contacts.\r\n\r\ncustom texting Messenger for SMS with countless emojis everything you want\r\n\r\nMessages for sending and receiving messages very fast, excellent, and private text messaging application\r\n\r\nReplace your old and boring text message application to New Messages is a new text message app and are completely free massage. With all your contacts & send message. Massages is the best for your messaging app, communication, MMS & private text message application. messenger for messaging is the new Version massage of New messages, msg app. messenger, as your default messaging app or we can say massage app. Message use as a private messaging app. This messaging app will allow you to stay connected by SMS text with your friends.\r\n\r\n\r\nPowerful Features:\r\n\r\n-<b>BACKUP & RESTORE</b>\r\n\u2714 Backup SMS & MMS messages\r\n\u2714 Restore deleted SMS & MMS message anytime\r\n\r\n-<b>SCHEDULE SMS</b>\r\n\u2714 Delayed SMS message give opportunity to correct the wrong message\r\n\u2714 Never miss any big moment with schedule SMS Messages\r\n\r\n- <b>SMS BLOCKER</b>\r\n\u2714 No worry about spam messages consume storage space with blocker\r\n\u2714 Block text messages via adding to SMS blocker\r\n\r\n-<b>FREE FUNNY SMS COLLECTION</b>\r\n\u2714 Love SMS, flirt SMS, romantic SMS, friendship SMS, greeting SMS and more\r\n\r\n-<b> ANDROID Messages App</b>\r\n\u2714 SMS Messages works perfectly on Android Wear\r\n\u2714 Get wear SMS Messages on your android wear\r\n\r\nMessages App - Message chat app and text Messaging App - send Smartly, simple, easy and text message app tool for android, comes with collecting all private messages, 3rd party text message. You can enjoy regular notifications, dual sim support, quick reply, group messages, etc., with the help of private Messages - Message Box & Chat App. You can make this Text Messages App as default message. This messaging app is great texting app.\r\n\r\nMessaging online is free and useful messaging app. Get access to the world and connect to your friends with the brand new messenger app. SMS Messages is now Free .\r\n\r\n<b>Features of messages app</b>:\r\n- Mark messages as read\r\n- Use messages app for android\r\n- Find messages and contacts easily\r\n- Switch to Dark Mode\r\n- Stay in touch with your friends and family\r\n- Pin message to the top part of chat\r\n- Clean, User Friendly, and comfortable design.\r\n- Signal Private of new Messenger.\r\n- Protect messages.\r\n- Chat app features.",
